### 9. Bell Notification — Purely Decorative
**File:** [src/components/layout/AppShell.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/layout/AppShell.tsx) (line 280)

**Problem:** The bell icon always shows a purple dot (hardcoded). There's no notification system, no dropdown, no count.

