## 🟡 Medium Priority — Incomplete UX

### 12. [CourseMaterials](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/CourseMaterials.tsx#3-22) — No Link to Course Page
The [CourseMaterials](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/CourseMaterials.tsx#3-22)/[CourseNotes](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/CourseNotes.tsx#1-11)/[CourseExams](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/CourseExams.tsx#1-11) tabs need to be properly wired. Currently only [CourseMaterials](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/CourseMaterials.tsx#3-22) passes `courseId` to its link — but with the wrong hardcoded file.

### 13. [UserUploads.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/UserUploads.tsx) — Search Bar Non-functional
The search `<input>` at line 111 has no `onChange` → no filtering. All uploads always show regardless of query.

### 14. [UserUploads.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/UserUploads.tsx) — "Delete" Button is Decorative
The "Delete" button for rejected requests (line 160–162) has no `onClick` handler and no confirmation dialog.

### 15. Admin Section — Not Themed with Glassmorphism
**Files:** [admin/AdminHome.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/admin/AdminHome.tsx), [admin/ModerationQueue.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/admin/ModerationQueue.tsx), [admin/AuditLog.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/pages/admin/AuditLog.tsx)

The admin pages use plain shadcn/ui `<Card>` components with the default light theme, while the rest of the app uses the premium dark glassmorphism design system. They look completely inconsistent.

### 16. [AssistantPanel.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/assistant/AssistantPanel.tsx) — File Name Hardcoded
Line 252: `"Introduction to Algorithms.pdf"` is hardcoded. Should show the actual current file's title, passed via props or derived from route params.

### 17. `CommandPalette` — Limited Scope
**File:** [src/components/ui/command-palette.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/ui/command-palette.tsx)

The command palette (`⌘K`) exists but likely only navigates to static routes. It should be able to search files from the catalog and jump to any file.

### 18. [CourseShell.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/layout/CourseShell.tsx) — Course ID Used as Display Label
Line 53: `{course.id.toUpperCase()}` is displayed as the badge label. Should use `course.code` which is the proper code (`CS101`). Currently both would render the same but semantically [id](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Documents/Programming%20projects/GeeksHub/GeeksHub/src/components/layout/AppShell.tsx#151-237) ≠ `code`.

